{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24839","headline":"夷陵郡内叙别 · 杨衡","name":"夷陵郡内叙别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"礼娶嗣明德，同牢夙所钦。\n况蒙生死契，岂顾蓬蒿心。\n雁币任野薄，恩爱缘义深。\n同声若鼓瑟，合韵似鸣琴。\n将迓空未立，就赘意难任。\n皎月托言誓，沧波信浮沈。\n荆台理晨辙，巫渚疑宵襟。\n悯悯百虑起，回回万恨深。\n候更促徒侣，先晓彻夜禽。\n灯彩凝寒风，蝉思噪密林。\n留念同心带，赠远芙蓉簪。\n抚怀极投漆，感物重黄金。\n分鸾岂遐阻，别劒念相寻。\n傥甘蓬户贱，愿俟故山岑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24839.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24839","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}